<title>INDIA: India Siemens postpones 96/97 results.</title>
<headline>India Siemens postpones 96/97 results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Siemens Ltd on Thursday said it had re-scheduled the announcement of its 1996/97 results to June 13 from May 30.</p>
<p>The company was due to hold a board meeting followed by a news conference on Friday to announces its results for the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The firm, in a statement, did not give reasons for the postponement.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
